            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Easier Slack setup through Chrome.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.9</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Setting up the Chrome extension is now a three-step checklist that ticks itself off as you go, with the animation showing exactly what to click.</li>
  <li>After Download, Jarvis shows where the folder went, with Show in Finder.</li>
  <li>Choosing Slack conversations is simpler: everything is selected to start, with Direct messages, Channels and Private channels you can open, search and untick.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
